{"title": "Boon of the Raven Queen", "pageid": 28536, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Boon_of_the_Raven_Queen", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Boon of the Raven Queen</b> is a passive feature that boosts the wearer's shapeshifting ability and grants the ability to float down gracefully from a tall height.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While wearing the amulet, the wearer's jump and flying speed increase by 1.5 m (5 ft), and they gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a> condition. Feather Fall's effect will persist while the wearer is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild-Shaped</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Feather_Fall\"> Condition: Feather Fall </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Feather_Fall_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall_(Condition)\" title=\"Feather Fall (Condition)\">Feather Fall</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Rate of falling is slowed, granting <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Immunity</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Falling_damage\" title=\"Falling damage\">Falling damage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corvid_Token\" title=\"Corvid Token\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Amulet_Necklace_F_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Corvid_Token\" title=\"Corvid Token\">Corvid Token</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Boon of the Raven Queen triggers the condition when any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Beast Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Beast_Shape_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorph Beast Shape (status group)\">Polymorph Beast Shape</a></span> status group is applied.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Queen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raven Queen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Queen\">Raven Queen</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201207\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2164/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20884/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5995/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 854034/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.495      1 -total\n 96.38%   50.594      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 33.81%   17.750      2 Template:Cond\n 26.53%   13.928      5 Template:Icon_text\n 25.07%   13.160      4 Template:Icon_link\n 24.04%   12.621     18 Template:Trim\n 20.39%   10.706      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 16.99%    8.918      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 16.74%    8.787      7 Template:Ifempty\n 13.63%    7.153      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28536-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201207 and revision id 374510. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}